            <div xml:id="d343">

                <pb facs="0560" n="514" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg514"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.21/330½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hot Springs, Va.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">27 December, 1915</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: Thank you for this. I
                    think I appreciate, as I know you do, the importance of an early confirmation,
                    or, rather, ratification, of the treaty with Colombia. I hope with all my heart
                    that that most desirable consummation may be brought about.</p>
                <p>Cordially and sincerely Yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
